OL,3,GNEWSAMake a Difference Awards 2026
OL,4,Ahonour local heroes
OL,5,
OL,6,FCommunity heroes across Surrey and
OL,7,FSussex have been honoured for the
OL,8,Fextraordinary difference they make to
OL,9,Fother people's lives at the 15th BBC
OL,10,FMake a Difference Awards.
OL,12,FThe event, held at Chequer Mead Theatre
OL,13,Fin East Grinstead, West Sussex, saw
OL,14,Fawards given in eight categories,
OL,15,Fincluding Great Neighbour, Young Hero
OL,16,Fand Animal.
OL,18,FThe accolade celebrates those who go
OL,19,Fabove and beyond, often without
OL,20,Frecognition, to support others and
OL,21,Fbring people together.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
